SRC/repunsel -- repunsel, as built for OS-9/68000=================================================ORIG holds repunsel.c, repunsel.l and the `destructions' notes as the postcarried them.  The post also carried a lex.yy.c made by its author's lex;it is left out, because a scanner generated by that lex contains lex's owndriver code.  lex.yy.c here was generated in universe instead, with thisdisk's flex 2.3, from repunsel.l -- as chef's, fudd's and pig's were.repunsel.c and repunsel.l are unchanged; repunsel.c supplies main andyywrap.